app_authorize.description:
No ACL update has arrived yet for:

**Client:** {client_name}

**Integrity code:** {integrity_code}

M2240x/ASI22 stations normally pair an additional app automatically when it uses the same MyBuildings account. The M22403-W has no panel approval screen; the generic ABB email mentioning panel approval also covers other products. If the official Welcome app shows this client as paired, do not unpair it. If it shows the station as unpaired and offers **Resend pairing request**, use that option. Wait a moment, then click **Submit** to poll again with the same saved identity.

pending_pairing.description:
Home Assistant has a saved app-managed pairing request. Resuming immediately polls for its ACL update, reuses the existing certificate, and does not send another pairing request.

**Client:** {client_name}

**Integrity code:** {integrity_code}

Choose **Resume saved pairing** unless this client has already been removed from the Welcome client list and MyBuildings.
